// Domio realtime.proto
//
// WebSocket sync protocol for Phase 04 realtime collaboration.
// Defines the frame vocabulary for CRDT-based deck editing, presence
// tracking, and branch management over WebSocket connections.
//
// All timestamps use a Hybrid Logical Clock (HLC) to provide
// causally-ordered, globally-unique event ordering without wall-clock
// synchronisation. An operation is accepted iff hlc > parent_hlc and
// hlc > last-seen for the author.
//
